# 15. Pricing Summary

This section provides a consolidated summary of Klaud’s partner net pricing across all engagement models.

All prices are listed in **USD** and are intended for **qualified partners only**. Pricing is not intended to be used as an end-customer-facing price list. Partners are responsible for defining their own resale pricing, commercial margin, contractual terms, and customer-facing proposal structure.

Final pricing is subject to scope validation, technical complexity, customer readiness, delivery assumptions, and agreed statement of work.

---

## 15.1 On-Demand Hourly Services

The On-Demand Hourly Services model provides flexible access to Klaud specialists on a time-and-materials basis.

| Service Type                               |                 Partner Net Rate |
| ------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------: |
| Standard senior VMware consulting          |                    **$165/hour** |
| Principal architect / advanced specialist  |                    **$195/hour** |
| Emergency, after-hours, or weekend support |                    **$260/hour** |
