## 15.8 Recommended Partner Resale Guidance

The pricing in this catalog is partner net pricing. Partners may add their own margin based on customer relationship, commercial strategy, project risk, and value delivered.

| Service Type                  | Suggested Partner Margin |
| ----------------------------- | -----------------------: |
| On-Demand Hourly Services     |                  25%–35% |
| Fixed-Price Service Bundles   |                  30%–45% |
| Partner Expert Capacity Plans |                  20%–30% |
| Emergency / Rescue Services   |                  35%–50% |

These resale ranges are provided as general guidance only. Partners remain responsible for defining their final customer-facing pricing.

