## 15.9 Pricing Notes

Unless otherwise stated:

* All prices are in **USD**.
* Prices exclude applicable taxes.
* Prices exclude travel and accommodation expenses.
* Pricing assumes remote delivery.
* Onsite delivery must be quoted or approved separately.
* Pricing is based on the scope and assumptions validated before delivery.
* Final pricing may vary depending on customer environment complexity.
* Services are subject to Klaud resource availability.
* Fixed-price bundles apply only to the agreed scope.
* Out-of-scope work may require a change order, hourly billing, or Expert Bank consumption.

